n\/swami\/interaction_pinchview\/focused(_:)"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Interaction_PinchView","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_PinchView"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a shape. A "},{"code":"MagnifyGesture","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (Origami’s magnification\/pinch input)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drives two "},{"code":"origami.PopSwitch","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" nodes that flip the shape between its base and an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enlarged state; the switch state feeds a "},{"code":"builtin.point3D","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" Transform Scale, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the pop is animated with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at base"},{"